--- !u!114 &1081375807
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1081375803}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: We're looking for a guy by the name of Jack... His nickname is Spartan
      Jack, have you seen him?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Mad
  - text: 'I know of a... Spartan Mike, a Spartan Steve...

      OH WAIT you''re
      talking about that guy that my white belt friend over here totally walloped!'
    name: Spartan Red Belt
    character: {fileID: 1081375806}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: Yeah Spartan Jack really got his butt handed to him! And then he came back
      looking for another fight and guess what happened?? White belt over here KNOCKED
      THAT LOSER OUT!
    name: Spartan Red Belt
    character: {fileID: 1081375806}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: He has the bruises to prove it and everything
    name: Spartan Red Belt
    character: {fileID: 1081375806}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: Do you know where he went after that?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1081375806}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: Heaven, probably
    name: Spartan Red Belt
    character: {fileID: 1081375806}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: (These Spartans are no help... Have they ever used their brain?)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Happy
  - text: '(Chrome Dome on the other hand...

      You''ve dealt with him before.
      He''s always up to something)'
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (You figure you should explore a little before ruling this place out)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
