--- !u!114 &1222583892
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1222583890}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Newbies, hold up\u2026"
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: 
  - text: What is it, Master Chief?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'I smell...

      I smell...'
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Mad
  - text: 'BULL!!!

      I knew I recognized you the moment you set foot in my school...
      But I couldn''t quite place it'
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: 'But then we fought, heads got knocked around, and I connected some dots...

      You''re
      with JADE!'
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: 'Jade?! How do you know I''m--

      know she even---

'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: "And if you're with Jade, she must've told you about our past\u2026 \n"
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "W.. What?\nBut\u2026 I killed Jade. With my own bare hands. We were NOT
      on the same side"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: "Liar! I don\u2019t know who you\u2019re trying to trick with this nonsense.
      Jade is very much alive. I can sense it."
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: "Alive? \nI swear I'm telling the truth\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: 'Oh, I know you beat her up.

      Knocked her off the roof, even. My
      spies told me all about that.'
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: 'But after she fell, did you stab her again?

'
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "Wh\u2014why would I--\nOnce was.. hard enough."
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: "Jade might be young but she\u2019s conniving. She must have\u2026 foresaw
      your battle! She must have used her\u2014her MAD COOKING SKILLS to craft a
      KNOCKOUT POTION! Yes! Which she used on herself to FAKE HER DEATH! And then
      she must have used SLIGHT OF HAND to flee the\u2014\r\n"
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: " Are you sure she\u2019s alive?"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Surprised
  - text: "She used the same tricks on me when I\u2026"
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Mad
  - text: "*Sigh* You really do know too much. Storm, I won\u2019t hold back this
      time."
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1484589694}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
