--- !u!114 &1222583899
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1222583890}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c530a24ea0ef8d34990d94afbefe7c3f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - "NIGHT 4 - STORM: Man, if I thought things were getting strange before\u2026"
  - "Spartan Jack is still gone. Somehow he managed to escape me and my squad, and
    I don\u2019t imagine he\u2019ll show up for You-Jitsu anytime soon."
  - "And what was up with Jade and the Spartan Dojo? That was just weird. I bet she
    knew something the rest of us didn\u2019t, something about our long time rival
    school."
  - If I find Jade myself, I imagine the conversation would be a bit.. Heated. I
    should probably send someone else tomorrow to do my bidding. But in the meantime,
    I have another midnight meeting to host.
