--- !u!114 &1791770169
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1791770167}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: Stretch? Is this...?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'I was trying to tell you earlier--

      That man who I met with in the
      alley...'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'It was dark, he was wearing a mask...

      But I think it was Chrome
      Dome.

      He was the one offering to buy the sword off me'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'I thought maybe crafting a replica would throw him off the trail...

      But
      the next day he came back with a vengeance.

'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'My butt would''ve been grass if your grandmaster dad hadn''t arrived in
      the nick of time--

      He''s the only one Chrome Dome is afraid of'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Ugh...

      I thought this guy was just some random jerk with a black
      belt'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: You're telling me. We're gonna have to rally the S.A.F.E. club and do something
      about this
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'In the meantime...

      Let''s get out of here before Chrome Dome finds
      out we''ve been snooping'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
